front/package-lock.json
# Root lockfile tracks repo-level tooling only (commitlint). It is
# intentional since the CI/CD tooling PR; do not add app dependencies
# at the root. front/ keeps its own separate lockfile (no workspace).
# /pnpm-lock.yaml is tracked on purpose.

